skills/s1-code-review/
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived from the "code-review" skill in mattpocock/skills
  https://github.com/mattpocock/skills (skills/engineering/code-review/SKILL.md)
  Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock
  MIT License: licenses/MIT-mattpocock-skills.txt

Modifications:
  - Dropped the dependency on the setup-matt-pocock-skills companion skill and on
    docs/agents/issue-tracker.md; issue lookup now uses whatever access the repo
    already has, and reports the issue as unfetched otherwise.
  - Added an advisory Jev judgment pass over the collected findings.
  - Added an instruction to read covering tests whether or not the diff changes
    them.

The evidence shape used by that pass (bounded candidate excerpts carrying file and
line, an explicit noMatch answer, and covering tests supplied as context) follows the
design of jev-review
  https://github.com/devagrawal09/jev-review
  Copyright (c) 2026 Dev Agrawal
  MIT License: licenses/MIT-devagrawal09-jev-review.txt
No code or prose from jev-review was copied, and its threshold filtering, list
truncation, cross-axis severity ranking, and dashboard were deliberately not adopted.

